<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3721" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτέον</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must lead</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				467e
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>one must treat</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς τρυφερώτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					2.9
				</span></i>
			; <i>one must bring</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ὑπόμνησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollon.Cit.
					3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰρήνην ἀκτέον</span>
			<i>one must keep</i> peace, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				3.40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				8.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>one must go, march</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				6.4.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Adj., <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτέος</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
				<i>to be drawn</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραμμαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					16.406
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be led away</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὸ κολασθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					23
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Arg.</u>
				2.3
			</span></i>.</div>
